{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1145905-2-5e-sidereal-astrology","id":1145905,"title":"2.5e Sidereal Astrology","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-01T15:57:48-07:00","id":1145905,"title":"2.5e Sidereal Astrology","content":"<span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">So I might be starting a 2.5 Exalted game, and I want to make sure I have the astrology down pat. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">I'm a Chosen of Serenity, and I have the Priest Merit. With a Charisma of 4 and a Performance of 4 with a specialization of Astrology, I have a pool of 9 with a difficulty of 5. I don't have any Charms that affect my Prayer or Effect Roll, but I can pray for 9 hours to add 3 to my Prayer roll. I'm not sure what a Petition does if I only get 1-4 successes, or if I just don't make a Petition other than disallowing Co- and Countersignatory.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">All told, I now have a pool of 12, and if I spend some motes, I can add automatic successes equal to my Essence (currently 3), with a difficulty of 5.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">For the Effect roll, I can Compose Plans. As far as I can tell, I can continue composing plans forever so long as I keep spending the days to do so, and I make an Int+Craft[Fate] roll (3+1) with a difficultly of 3 if I'm crafting a Resplendent Destiny. If I make the unlikely roll, I can add 1 die for every 4 successes. I can also add 3 dice by wearing a throwaway Destiny for 3 days. Computing Horoscopes is an Int + Occult (3+2) with a difficulty ... 1? I think that's the difficulty. But can I do that where ever? The book says the instruments are usually only available in major cities, but I'm not sure if that is for purchase or if they're more like those giant telescope buildings. Regardless, 1/4 of success are added to the effect roll.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Total Effect Roll is Essence 3 + College 1 + 1/4 of Prayer successes.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Since I'm likely to generate about 9 successes on the Prayer roll, my effect roll is 7 dice.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\">Is there anything that I missed?</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12114-the-random-npc","name":"The Random NPC","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-02T12:10:24-07:00","id":1146120,"title":"","content":"Off the bat, do you mean you <i>effectively</i> have the priest merit, or did you actually take it? Sidereals are all priests by nature, like Zeniths and No-Moons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-02T13:27:49-07:00","id":1146148,"title":"","content":"Both, I took the 7 BP merit, but I only paid 6 cause I automatically get the 1 BP version.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12114-the-random-npc","name":"The Random NPC","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-01T23:52:55-07:00","id":1154993,"title":"","content":"So I guess no one has any input?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12114-the-random-npc","name":"The Random NPC","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}